  "version": 1,
  "provenance": {
    "fixed_map_cell_types": "map.c fixed-map initialization reads each descriptor offset40, sets columns=backgroundWidth*8 and rows=backgroundHeight*16, and func_080E55E4 indexes every byte as a MapCell.unk_02 cell type with an explicit0..6 switch and default behavior. Five distinct bounded cell-type grids are shared by six fixed-map descriptors; complete grids and dimensions agree in US/JP/EU. These are logical cell classifications, not graphics or opaque padding.",
    "fixed_map_definitions": "Six fixed-map definitions are selected explicitly by func_080EA20C. Background blocks have width*height entries; byte grids have width*8 by height*16 entries. Native records are80 bytes US/JP and84 EU with a compressed-resource flag; divergent EU tile lengths have field-only guards. Adjacent14-entry spawn and event indices are distinct native array types, not extra fixed-map definitions."
  },
